sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Edge as Edge service (site camera)
    participant Ingest as Ingest API (/api/v1/events)
    participant Outbox as Outbox + relay
    participant Bus as RabbitMQ
    participant Consumer as Notification consumer
    participant Rules as Rule engine (dedup/throttle/prefs)
    participant Store as Notification table
    participant WS as STOMP/WebSocket
    participant Push as FCM/APNs
    participant Owner as Vehicle owner (mobile app)

    Edge->>Ingest: POST track_id/slot change\n(eventId, occurredAt)
    Ingest->>Outbox: persist ParkingEvent(VehicleRelocated)\n+ outbox row (1 tx)
    Outbox->>Bus: publish VehicleRelocated
    Bus->>Consumer: deliver (events.notification queue)
    Consumer->>Rules: evaluate severity + owner preferences
    alt duplicate within throttle window
        Rules-->>Consumer: drop (dedup key = vehicle_id+type+window)
    else new / outside window
        Rules->>Store: insert Notification(channel=push,type=VehicleRelocated)
        Rules->>Store: insert Notification(channel=ws,type=VehicleRelocated)
        Rules->>WS: publish to /topic/vehicle/{vehicleId}
        Rules->>Push: send FCM/APNs payload
        WS-->>Owner: realtime toast (if app open)
        Push-->>Owner: push notification (if app backgrounded)
        Owner->>Owner: taps notification -> getVehicleLocation()
    end
